# Consumer keep rules for :core.
#
# This project keeps R8 rules in *.keep files (see app/src/main/keepRules). Add a rule here only
# for a :core symbol that must survive R8 in a consuming app; ordinary library code needs none.

# Model enum constant names
# Kotpref's enumValuePref/nullableEnumValuePref stores the constant name in SharedPreferences, the
# playlist cache stores enum names in database columns, and several overlays look constants up with
# valueOf() at runtime. Renaming a constant would silently reset the setting.
-keep enum com.neilturner.aerialviews.models.enums.** { *; }
